## 13) Important security notes for banking apps

Do not ship a banking app without:
- HTTPS only
- certificate pinning
- MFA
- biometric re-auth for sensitive actions
- server-side session validation
- device integrity checks
- no sensitive data in logs
- no hardcoded secrets
- root/jailbreak detection
- secure screenshot handling for sensitive screens
- transaction signing / step-up auth for transfers

