## 13) How sync works

### Offline
- User creates/edits/deletes surveys.
- Changes are written immediately to SQLite.
- Each change is also appended to `sync_queue`.
- UI reads from local DB, so it works without internet.

### Reconnected
- App detects connectivity.
- `syncPendingChanges()` sends queued operations to the server in order.
- On success, queue items are removed and local records marked `synced`.
- On failure, sync stops and retries later.

