# 5) How it works

## Local-first storage
- Every survey is saved to IndexedDB first.
- The UI reads from IndexedDB, so it works without internet.

## Sync queue
- Every create/delete is added to `pending`.
- When online, the app sends all pending mutations to `/sync`.

## Conflict handling
- The server uses `updatedAt`.
- If a newer record arrives, it overwrites the older one.
- This is a simple last-write-wins strategy.

