# 4) How it works

### Offline save
When the user submits a survey:

- it is saved to IndexedDB immediately
- it is added to a local queue
- UI updates right away

### Sync on reconnect
When the browser comes back online:

- the app reads queued records from IndexedDB
- sends them to the server
- marks them synced
- removes them from the queue

