## 5) How it works

### Real-time visualization
- A timer simulates live data updates every second.
- The chart updates with new request-per-second values.
- Metrics cards refresh alongside the chart.

### Form handling
- Users can change:
  - refresh rate
  - alert threshold
  - theme
- Submitting the form applies settings immediately.

### Interactivity
- Pause/resume the stream.
- Threshold warnings appear in the event log.
- Theme switching updates the UI.

