## Important note about toggling rules

In this initial version, the popup toggle updates the saved state, but the ruleset itself remains enabled. To make the toggle actually turn blocking on/off, you should use:

```js
chrome.declarativeNetRequest.updateEnabledRulesets(...)
```

That requires moving the ruleset management into the background script or popup logic.

