## To connect to real stock data

If you have a WebSocket feed, you can replace the simulated update logic with something like:

```js
const ws = new WebSocket('wss://your-feed.example.com');

ws.onmessage = (event) => {
  const updates = JSON.parse(event.data);
  updates.forEach(update => {
    const stock = stocks.find(s => s.ticker === update.ticker);
    if (stock) {
      stock.prev = stock.price;
      stock.price = update.price;
      stock.change = +(((stock.price - stock.prev) / stock.prev) * 100).toFixed(2);
    }
  });
  render();
};
```

