## To connect to real stock data

Replace the simulated `updatePrices()` with something like:

```js
async function updatePrices() {
  const res = await fetch('/api/stock-prices');
  const data = await res.json();

  data.forEach(item => {
    const s = stocks.find(x => x.ticker === item.ticker);
    if (s) {
      s.price = item.price;
      s.prevClose = item.prevClose;
      s.changePct = ((s.price - s.prevClose) / s.prevClose) * 100;
    }
  });

  render();
}
```

