## To connect a real data source

Replace the simulated update loop with something like:

```js
const socket = new WebSocket("wss://your-feed.example.com");

socket.onmessage = (event) => {
  const updates = JSON.parse(event.data);
  updates.forEach(update => {
    const item = data.find(d => d.ticker === update.ticker);
    if (item) {
      item.prevPrice = item.price;
      item.price = update.price;
      item.changePct = ((item.price - item.prevPrice) / item.prevPrice) * 100;
    }
  });
  layout();
};
```

