## 6) Important limitations of this initial version

This is intentionally simple and uses **in-memory state**, so:

- Data is lost when the server restarts
- No authentication or user accounts
- No per-project boards
- No optimistic UI updates
- No conflict resolution for simultaneous edits
- Drag-and-drop is column-based only, not precise task reordering within a column

