# 14) Low-latency design recommendations

## Hot path rules
- No database calls in matching path
- No network calls in matching path
- No locks if avoidable
- No floating point
- Pre-allocate buffers
- Use fixed-size structs where possible
- Keep per-symbol state local to one goroutine/thread

## Partitioning model
- `symbol -> partition`
- each partition has:
  - one matching engine
  - one event stream
  - one recovery log
- scale by adding partitions and rebalancing symbols

