## `InMemoryEventBus.java`
```java
package com.example.trading.bus;

import com.example.trading.core.Event;

import java.util.List;
import java.util.concurrent.CopyOnWriteArrayList;

public final class InMemoryEventBus implements EventBus {
    private final List<EventHandler> handlers = new CopyOnWriteArrayList<>();

    @Override
    public void publish(Event event) {
        for (EventHandler handler : handlers) {
            handler.onEvent(event);
        }
    }

    @Override
    public void subscribe(EventHandler handler) {
        handlers.add(handler);
    }
}
```

> Note: `CopyOnWriteArrayList` is simple, but for very high throughput you’d likely replace this with a **single-threaded dispatcher + ring buffer**.

