## Important limitations of this initial version

This is a **starter implementation**, not yet true ultra-low-latency dataplane software.

### Current limitations
- Uses UDP sockets, not raw NIC access
- No batching of packet I/O
- No lock-free queues
- No CPU pinning / NUMA awareness
- No kernel bypass
- No checksum validation or rewrite
- No Ethernet/VLAN parsing
- No forwarding table / next-hop resolution
