## Minimal working implementation outline

### Data structures
```c
typedef struct {
    uint32_t src_ip;
    uint32_t dst_ip;
    uint16_t src_port;
    uint16_t dst_port;
    uint8_t proto;
} flow_key_t;

typedef struct flow_entry {
    flow_key_t key;
