## What it does

For each observed IPv4 TCP/UDP flow, it tracks:

- source IP
- destination IP
- source port
- destination port
- protocol
- packet count
- byte count
- first seen time
- last seen time

It prints a flow when it has been idle for more than 30 seconds, and also prints all remaining flows on exit.

