## 5) Basic simulation step

A minimal physics step:

1. Apply gravity and forces
2. Integrate velocities
3. Detect collisions
4. Resolve contacts
5. Update transforms

```cpp
void PhysicsWorld::StepSimulation(float deltaTime)
{
    if (deltaTime <= 0.0f)
        return;

    for (auto& body : Bodies)
    {
        if (body.IsStatic || !body.IsAwake)
            continue;

        IntegrateForces(body, deltaTime);
    }

    DetectCollisions();
    ResolveCollisions();

    for (auto& body : Bodies)
    {
        if (body.IsStatic || !body.IsAwake)
            continue;

        IntegrateVelocity(body, deltaTime);
    }
}
```

